From ff544b0f00cdc249957f4af7e2e8d3cb9f2097f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 21:10:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Port HRPT permit-sync storage from Supabase to Cloudflare
 D1
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the hand-written PostgREST client (src/hrpt/supabaseClient.js)
with a D1 Workers-binding client (src/hrpt/d1Client.js), adds the D1
schema migration, updates sync.js/wrangler.jsonc/.dev.vars.example
accordingly, and ports the test suite to a fake D1 binding instead of
mocked Supabase HTTP calls. Scoped to the HRPT pipeline only — auth and
the DPR/NYC-Parks Supabase reads in public/TrueSpordo.html are untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K6wNm6Egrsk6EfrFh2YdtX
